 (text "DC link present LED, R49 100 k bleeder" (at 627.38 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dfc56c9f-fa85-51b6-abcd-8e99540b0977))
 (text "GATE DRIVER BLOCKS: control header with common-mode chokes, 2EDF7275K input filters, R_ON / D + R_OFF, star, R_G per transistor (block 1 drives Q1-Q4, block 2 drives Q5-Q8)" (at 25.40 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2ebf2b15-6e08-52eb-bf6a-10e4e32e306b))
 (text "BLOCK 1" (at 30.48 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid beba918b-450c-5ed2-872a-36359278eb83))
 (text "NTC on the control side (board temperature at the driver)" (at 33.02 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3e5b50b9-3ea2-5194-8fc5-8a44ec982be4))
 (text "SLDON = GNDI: input-side LDO on" (at 139.70 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4a17f079-a6b8-5691-aa8b-47824436d13b))
 (text "R_ON 0.75 R, R_OFF 0 R (jumper), R_G 0.5 R per transistor, 10 k gate pull-down at the star to the Kelvin net" (at 139.70 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 639b6fd7-a4e5-5f6a-8482-0d992ec2a807))
 (text "BLOCK 2" (at 436.88 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7b57d2ea-44c9-5083-826f-d0d36ea95dcb))
 (text "SLDON = GNDI: input-side LDO on" (at 546.10 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 61efc042-271b-50d0-ae02-26576d149aaf))
 (text "R_ON 0.75 R, R_OFF 0 R (jumper), R_G 0.5 R per transistor, 10 k gate pull-down at the star to the Kelvin net" (at 546.10 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 64049e20-3cac-51a5-a2e7-0d9c4e5e542b))
 (text "GATE SUPPLY ISLANDS: external isolated supply (one HS, one LS, split per block) -> WE-CNSW -> 5.1 V Zener VDD-S, 150 R bias S-VEE: V_GS,on = +5.1 V, V_GS,off = -(V_ISO - 5.1 V)" (at 25.40 266.70 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ef15aaf7-1b1c-509b-9aa9-def6327993f5))
 (text "J3 / L1: HS block 1" (at 33.02 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 74584e7b-e4ba-5d4c-93a2-ee9d62408eca))
 (text "J4 / L2: LS block 1" (at 236.22 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 442dd356-75df-51b7-88e4-6a3eef8e0955))
 (text "J12 / L8: HS block 2" (at 439.42 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 39bec625-fa6c-5a72-8795-3441859a7979))
 (text "J13 / L9: LS block 2" (at 642.62 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9dd665f9-f29c-5cde-864b-2de83924025b))
 (text "U.FL MEASUREMENT PORTS (bottom side, at each cell): V_GS HS / LS (0 R, shield = Kelvin), V_DS LS (953 R series = 20:1 into the 50 R scope input, shield = LS source = DC-)" (at 25.40 325.12 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c5ae121d-5809-509a-89b6-0acfe59520a0))
 (text "MOUNTING: H1-H4 board corners (insulated), H5-H7 heatsink spreader; heatsink HS1 (Fischer LAM 4, 100 mm, rotated 90 deg, tube across the board width) is a board-only item" (at 25.40 383.54 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5c76d853-7973-596e-98f4-f9c5e393f7c1))
 (text "Nets: DCP = DC+, DCN = DC-, SW = joined switch node of all four cells.  KH1/KH2 and KL1/KL2 are the Kelvin source nets (pad 2 of each EPC2361); they meet the power source only inside the package." (at 25.40 414.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 881cd126-7f8b-5784-86d7-32de5a8ac2ff))
 (text "LS power source = DC- directly (no shunt).  The LS gate drive and the LS supply are referenced to the Kelvin net KLx, not to DC-." (at 25.40 419.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid af5b2fdb-de88-50ea-83d7-17a5c0f67b7d))
 (text "Block suffix 1/2 on every driver-side net (GNDI1, VDDA2, ...).  Control side (CTRLx 2 x 5 header): PWM_H, PWM_L, DIS, 12 V and (block 1) NTC each with their own return C_RTN_* through one WE-CNSW common-mode choke per pair; 12 V then through a ferrite bead.  The control side is a top-layer-only area with a 1200 V barrier (4 mm outer, 3 mm L2) to all power copper; see reports/pcb-rules/PCB_rules_and_checklist.md." (at 25.40 424.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ec72a547-41eb-5585-8096-8a1dabb0354f))
 (text "No short-circuit protection on this board.  Closed-loop control from a TI TMS320F28379D over the CTRL headers." (at 25.40 429.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8ba96e42-3412-5a5f-937e-98422cdf2a6b))
